# RULES: ARCHITECTURE

## Role

Define the layer structure, boundaries, and dependencies of the project.

## What to fill in during synthesis

- recognized layers and packages and their roles;
- dependency rules between layers (who may depend on whom);
- dependency-injection and object-creation pattern;
- state and data-access rules;
- structural prohibitions (e.g. presentation layer accessing infrastructure directly);
- validator-checkable invariants, when present.

## Typical triggers

- service/store/DI creation or modification;
- new integration or boundary;
- refactoring with structural impact.
